    {
      "file": "src/containers/TopbarContainer/Topbar/TopbarDesktop/TopbarDesktop.js",
      "description": "Check and return `<WishlistLink />`, otherwise return `null`\n\n```jsx\n  const wishlistLinkMaybe = authenticatedOnClientSide ? (\n    <WishlistLink linkClassName={css.topbarLink} linkLabelClassName={css.topbarLinkLabel} />\n  ) : null;\n\n```",
