    {
      "file": "src/containers/TopbarContainer/Topbar/TopbarDesktop/TopbarDesktop.js",
      "description": "Add a new menu item for `My Wishlist` to show it in the profile menu\n\n```jsx\n        <MenuItem key=\"WishlistPage\">\n          <NamedLink\n            className={classNames(css.menuLink, currentPageClass('WishlistPage'))}\n            name=\"WishlistPage\"\n          >\n            <span className={css.menuItemBorder} />\n            <FormattedMessage id=\"TopbarDesktop.myWishlistLink\" />\n          </NamedLink>\n        </MenuItem>\n```",
      "line": 82
