      "description": "Assign the `<WishlistLink />` component to `wishlistLinkMaybe` if the user is authenticated, otherwise return null\n\n```jsx\nconst wishlistLinkMaybe = authenticatedOnClientSide ? <WishlistLink /> : null;\n```",
